       ossivel/virr, ruled 2026-09-28). Same per-species pattern as the
       three above: HediffWithComps + HediffCompProperties_ExplodeOnDeath,
       Flame 40, destroyBody false, given by PawnKindDef.startingHediffs.
       ================================================================= -->

